<p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">{{#if firstName}}Hallo {{firstName}},{{else}}Hallo,{{/if}}</p>
<h2 style="color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">Beenden des Ladevorgangs fehlgeschlagen</h2>
<p style="color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">Das CSMS hat {{attempts}} Mal versucht, diesen Ladevorgang zu beenden, und ist jedes Mal gescheitert. Der Ladevorgang ist jetzt mit dem Stoppgrund EndRequestFailed als fehlerhaft markiert. Es wurden keine Kosten abgerechnet und eine eventuelle Zahlungsreservierung wurde storniert.</p>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin-bottom:24px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Ladevorgangs-ID</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{sessionId}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Station</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{stationId}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{#if siteName}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Standort</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{siteName}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if transactionId}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Transaktions-ID</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{transactionId}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if endRequestReason}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Grund der Beendigung</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{endRequestReason}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if startedAt}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Gestartet</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{startedAt}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if endedAt}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Beendet</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{endedAt}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
</table>
<p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">Bitte prüfen Sie den Ladevorgang im CSMS und rechnen Sie ihn manuell mit dem Fahrer ab, falls die Ladung bezahlt werden soll.</p>
